---
alwaysApply: false
---

- apply: all GitHub issue MCP ops
- repo: `naturelle137/AeroDash`
- tools: `search_issues` `list_issues` `issue_read` `issue_write` `add_issue_comment`

- types: `Bug` `Feature` (`Task` discontinued)
- scope.domain: `product` `engineering`
- scope.module: `ac` `ap` `ad` `fe` `mb` `pf` `wx` `ui` `uq` `sys` `doc` `sc` `repo`
- tag.safety: `safety-critical`
- status.active: `open` `accepted`
- status.closed: `fixed` `duplicate` `wont do`

- type.`Bug`: flaw error failure
- type.`Feature`: new capability enhancement infra docs requirements contributing
- type.`Task`: DISCONTINUED — never create; no `Task` issue, no `Task` label, no parent/child sub-issue link; split large work into independent `Feature`/`Bug`

- flow.create: add `open`
- flow.`open`: `accepted` | `duplicate` | `wont do`
- flow.`accepted`: `fixed` (PR merged to `develop`) | `wont do`
- flow.close.`fixed`: PR merged to `develop` | `release/*` | `hotfix/*`; use `Closes #` keyword
- flow.close.`duplicate`: canonical issue link required
- flow.close.`wont do`: rationale required
- legacy.existing_task: existing `Task` issues are processed by `/implement-issue` until closed; create no new ones

- safety.path: `frontend/src/core/`
- safety.match: calculations formulas weight balance performance Go/No-Go
- safety.on_create_update: add `safety-critical`
- safety.unclear: ask user
- safety.omission: forbidden on clear P1 impact

- dedupe.before_create: `search_issues`
- dedupe.on_match: show match
- dedupe.next: offer update vs new
- dedupe.create_gate: explicit user confirm

- create.title.`Bug`: `[Bug]: `
- create.labels.`Bug`: `Bug` `open`
- create.required.`Bug`: `description` `reproduction` `severity` `environment`
- create.optional.`Bug`: `hazard_ref`
- create.checks.`Bug`: duplicate_checked not_security_report

- create.title.`Feature`: `[Feat]: `
- create.labels.`Feature`: `Feature` `open`
- create.required.`Feature`: `problem` `solution` `dod`
- create.optional.`Feature`: `req_id` `safety_impact`
- create.checks.`Feature`: duplicate_checked not_already_implemented

- create.`Task`: FORBIDDEN — the `Task` type and parent/child sub-issues are discontinued

- create.labels.extra: one `scope.module` + one `scope.domain`
- create.labels.never: `fixed` `duplicate` `wont do`
- create.body: template field order; required always; optional when known
- create.blank_issue: false
- create.question_route: [Discussion / Question](https://github.com/naturelle137/AeroDash/discussions)

- update.read_first: `issue_read` before body label status changes
- update.status: unchanged unless valid `flow.*`
- update.labels: preserve; removal needs documented reason
- update.body: append or patch; no full overwrite without user request
- update.subissue_link: never create or modify a parent/child sub-issue link (discontinued)

- forbid.hardcode: no invented types labels scopes template fields
- forbid.fabrication: no invented hazard refs requirement IDs environment
- forbid.no_open: blocked
- forbid.skip_dedupe: blocked
- forbid.task_create: creating a `Task` issue or applying the `Task` label — blocked
- forbid.subissue_link: creating or modifying any parent/child native sub-issue — blocked
